    "npc.mark.dialogue.intro":  "I'm Mark. I help newcomers get settled in the city. Around here you earn your place yourself: learn to defend yourself, find a home, and keep your keys close. Let's start with a short test.",
    "npc.mark.dialogue.started":  "Start with the basics. Equip your fists and hit me three times. Don't worry — I can take it. You can track the assignment on the right side of the screen.",
    "npc.mark.dialogue.hit":  "The test is still in progress. Equip your fists and land three clean hits on me. Your current progress is shown below.",
    "npc.mark.dialogue.doors":  "Good, you can stand up for yourself. Here's $50. Now find an available place and buy two doors. You'll receive your keys when you're done.",
    "npc.mark.dialogue.spawn":  "You have your keys. Now learn how construction works: press Q, open the props menu, and place any prop. Completing this step unlocks the Physgun.",
    "npc.mark.dialogue.physgun":  "The Physgun is now in your inventory. Equip it and grab the prop you just placed with primary attack. Then I'll unlock the Toolgun.",
    "npc.mark.dialogue.toolgun":  "The Toolgun is unlocked. Open Q, select Remover, equip the Toolgun, and remove your prop with primary attack.",
    "npc.mark.dialogue.return":  "Nice work. You now understand property, props, the Physgun, and the Toolgun. Turn in the training and I'll give you the final reward.",
    "npc.mark.dialogue.complete":  "Excellent. You can defend yourself and you have a place to stay. Take $100 and a burger for the road. Come back later — I may have more work.",
    "npc.mark.dialogue.finished":  "You've already mastered the basics. I don't have another assignment for you yet, but check back later.",
    "npc.mark.dialogue.error":  "I can't continue this conversation right now. Try talking to me again in a moment.",
